CORE libstdcxx
main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[handler\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Fixed (soundness): a destructor without a noexcept-specifier was taken
as potentially-throwing, so the exception reached the handler of main.
implicit_exception_specifications now computes [except.spec]/7.
